'''Cupid''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was obtainable by unboxing the [[2026 Valentine's Box]] for 30 [[Heart Gems]] [[File:Heart Gem.png|25x25px]] or 60 [[Diamonds|Gems]] [[File:Diamond icon.png|25x25px]] during the [[Valentines Event 2026|2026 Valentine's Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
The handle has off-white cupid-like wings, hence the name. The guard is gold and the handle is alternating stripes of gold and white, with a red heart in the middle.

== Trivia ==

* This knife is commonly paired with Lightbringer, though they are not official set.
